1
00:00:00,467 --> 00:00:04,887
(Howard:)-Hold on. I'll walk down with you.
-Oh, that's not necessary.

2
00:00:05,055 --> 00:00:06,935
(Sheldon:)You can go first.

3
00:00:07,099 --> 00:00:08,389
(Howard:)Or we could go together.

4
00:00:09,643 --> 00:00:12,273
(Sheldon:)I can't think of a reason why not.

5
00:00:12,854 --> 00:00:14,894
(Howard:)-Let's go.
-Hold on.

6
00:00:15,232 --> 00:00:17,272
(Sheldon:)Nope. No reason.

7
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,740
(Raj:)I've missed you.

8
00:00:30,914 --> 00:00:33,164
(Sheldon:)All right,
say hello to your mother for me.

9
00:00:33,375 --> 00:00:34,755
(Penny:)Okay.

10
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:40,926
(Penny:)What?

11
00:00:41,675 --> 00:00:43,805
(Howard:)You said you were going for a walk.

12
00:00:44,428 --> 00:00:46,598
(Sheldon:)I didn't say outside.

13
00:00:48,181 --> 00:00:50,641
So what, you're gonna walk
up and down the stairs?

14
00:00:51,309 --> 00:00:53,599
(Sheldon:)No, of course not.

15
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:57,020
(Sheldon:)That would be odd
and suspicious behavior.

